{
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "发电量下滑，电费收入却还能收上来，钱从哪来？",
      "seconds": 4.176,
      "kind": "real_image",
      "scene_id": "V01",
      "asset_id": "R01",
      "local_path": "D:\\finance-media-ai\\content\\jobs\\v6_power_first_film\\remaster_v2\\assets\\real\\_staging\\coal_power_plant_Coal_power_plant_52135634496_jpg.jpg",
      "credit": "Mussi Katz from Israel · CC0"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "发电量下滑，收入却还能收上来——这就是第二张收入表。",
      "seconds": 4.536,
      "kind": "real_image",
      "scene_id": "V02",
      "asset_id": "R03",
      "local_path": "D:\\finance-media-ai\\content\\jobs\\v6_power_first_film\\remaster_v2\\assets\\real\\_staging\\grid_control_room_20240407_USDA_RD_AR_LSC_D810L_0685_53892746738_jpg.jpg",
      "credit": "USDAgov · Public domain"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "它叫容量电价，利润跟电量脱钩，不再绑在一根绳上。",
      "seconds": 4.32,
      "kind": "animation",
      "scene_id": "A03",
      "asset_id": "",
      "local_path": "",
      "credit": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "估值依据也跟着换：从红利资产，变成AI的能源底座。",
      "seconds": 5.16,
      "kind": "animation",
      "scene_id": "A04",
      "asset_id": "",
      "local_path": "",
      "credit": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "但先别急着兴奋，反证在这儿：2026年上半年行业利润同比降6.2%。",
      "seconds": 6.648,
      "kind": "real_image",
      "scene_id": "V05",
      "asset_id": "R10",
      "local_path": "D:\\finance-media-ai\\content\\jobs\\v6_power_first_film\\remaster_v2\\assets\\real\\_staging\\china_plant_shuozhou_Shuozhou_coal_power_plant_JPG.JPG",
      "credit": "Kleineolive · CC BY 3.0"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "利润在降，说明这是存量再分配，不是总量扩张。",
      "seconds": 4.248,
      "kind": "animation",
      "scene_id": "A06",
      "asset_id": "",
      "local_path": "",
      "credit": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "一句话：钱没变多，只是分法变了，别把再分配看成新蛋糕。",
      "seconds": 5.784,
      "kind": "real_image",
      "scene_id": "V07",
      "asset_id": "R02",
      "local_path": "D:\\finance-media-ai\\content\\jobs\\v6_power_first_film\\remaster_v2\\assets\\real\\_staging\\substation_transformer_Electrical_substation_of_railways_in_Vizianagaram_jpg.jpg",
      "credit": "Saiphani02 · CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
